Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Pedro,

Yes, use the multigroup function and organize your data in 50 columns. Group A, who answered exam A, should be have only NA in colums 6-10, Group B, should have NAs in columns 1-5. You will also need a column to identify to which group each individual belongs to.

Good luck,

Hugo

